<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>一次规划失效，是因为五个前提同时不成立</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>01 任务分配 · 问题与决策</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>五条特征是问题域的结构属性：拿掉任意一条，静态一次性规划就够用。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 748, gap: 6}}><Box style={{width: 748, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>① 任务持续到达</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务池按周期演化 T(t+1) = remain ∪ new ∪ release；新到、滞留与故障释放并存，上一周期方案会失效。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 748, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>② 供不应求</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>广域巡检万基量级杆塔 vs 单机日 15–50 基；「全部执行」不是理想而是不可行，取舍本身是决策。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 748, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>③ 多机巢异源起降</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>起点由 UAV 当前停靠巢给定，终点机巢是决策变量且受泊位容量竞争，不必返原巢。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 748, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>④ 三维地形代价</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>航段代价取 DEM 垂直切面三维航程，障碍包络 = 地形 + 建筑屋顶；ETA 与代价同源，平面欧氏距离失真。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 748, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 3}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>⑤ 机队状态动态且异构</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>位置、剩余航程、可用性逐周期变化；各机 max_range / max_time / speed 可不同，充电中的机不计幻影容量。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 396, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 16, gap: 14}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>结论：三个默认前提被逐条推翻</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务集固定 → 必须滚动时域周期重规划</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>全部执行 → 允许 y = 0，选择性接纳成为合法决策</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>平面距离 → 三维航程同时进约束、目标与 ETA</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>一句话定位：任务分配是连接任务需求、飞行可行性与机队资源管理的关键决策环节。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>因此方法必须回答三个问题：这一周期飞哪些、由谁按什么顺序飞、落哪个巢——并且要在有限时间内可解。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>04 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>